The plugin distributed from this repository contains no third-party source. Interface Review and Motion Review were rewritten as Compound Design resources; the upstream skills that informed their heuristics are cited in `compound-design/SOURCES.md` and are not loaded, required or shipped at runtime. The pinned upstream checkout under `compound-design/vendor/` is fetched only to run benchmark condition B, is gitignored, and is not redistributed.

